## Do not rely on one channel

Use relevant agency websites and apps and local emergency broadcasts. Power, mobile coverage and internet access can fail.{{state-block:get-ready}}

If there is an immediate threat to life, call **000**. For current incident advice, open [official warnings](/warnings).

